WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.866
"Let's go on a trip!" said Cow.

2
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:33.975
"A trip?" asked Pig.

3
00:00:33.976 --> 00:00:37.089
"Yes," said Cow.

4
00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.189
"We can see new things!"

5
00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:45.246
"I know," said Dog.

6
00:00:45.247 --> 00:00:48.447
"Let's go to the park!"

7
00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:51.782
"What's at the park?" asked Cow.

8
00:00:51.783 --> 00:00:55.004
"There's a lake," said Dog.

9
00:00:55.005 --> 00:01:00.187
"And frogs and ducks and bikes and swings."

10
00:01:00.188 --> 00:01:03.612
"Is there anything to eat?" asked Pig.

11
00:01:03.613 --> 00:01:06.632
"I don't know," said Dog.

12
00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.920
"But there is mud."

13
00:01:08.921 --> 00:01:11.823
"Mud?" cried Pig.

14
00:01:11.824 --> 00:01:16.381
"Yes," said Dog. "Mud!"

15
00:01:16.382 --> 00:01:19.684
"Ooh!" said Pig.

16
00:01:19.685 --> 00:01:23.076
"How I love mud!"

17
00:01:23.077 --> 00:01:26.548
"Where is the park?" asked Cow.

18
00:01:26.549 --> 00:01:29.732
"I know the way," said Dog.

19
00:01:29.733 --> 00:01:32.838
"I will take you there."

20
00:01:32.839 --> 00:01:36.118
"Let's tell Cat!" said Cow.

21
00:01:36.119 --> 00:01:40.246
"And Bat!" said Pig.

22
00:01:40.247 --> 00:01:52.552
"Cat! Bat!" called Cow.

23
00:01:52.553 --> 00:01:57.501
"We are going on a trip!"

